{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "เฮ้! คุณน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "สวัสดี!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "คุณอยากออกไปจากที่นี่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "ถ้าอยาก ก็มาช่วยฉันหากุญแจหน่อย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "บ้าจริง! มันไม่ได้อยู่ในนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "มันไม่อยู่ในนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "ไม่เจออะไรเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "เจอแล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "ฉันนึกว่าคุณจะตัวเล็กกว่านี้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "คุณตัวสูง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "เหมือนพี่สาวฉันเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "พี่สาวเธอเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "ใช่ พี่สาวฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "อย่าบอกนะว่าคุณไม่เคยเจอพี่น่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "เอ่อ... ฉันคิดว่าฉันเคยเจอนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "นี่คุณเต็มไหมเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "เอ่อ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "ดูท่าจะไม่เต็มแฮะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "มาเถอะ มาช่วยฉันหากุญแจหน่อย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "เอาล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "เอาเหล็กใส่ในท่อนั่นให้หน่อยสิ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "ขอบคุณมาก!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "จากนั้น... ก็เอาไม้นั่นลงมาให้ฉัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "ขอบใจ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "ช่วยอีกอย่างหน่อยนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "เสร็จแล้วล่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "ว้าว สวยจังเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "กดปุ่มนี่เลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "เรียบร้อย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "หยิบไปเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "มันคือกุญแจของคุณ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "ฉันคือมิตะจิบิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "เต็มไปด้วยบทพูดมากมาย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "มีโมเดลที่ดูดีและเรียบง่าย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "แถมยังมีผมที่สวยสุด ๆ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "ตาทึ่มเอ้ยยย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "คุณนี่มันน่ารักจริง ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "ที่ถามคำถามทึ่ม ๆ แบบนั้น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "แต่ก็เอาเถอะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "นี่คือครั้งแรกที่เราเจอกัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "คือ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "ถ้าคุณลอกเลียนแบบลุคสุดปังฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "ฉันจะทำให้คุณเสียใจ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "คุณยังไม่เข้าใจอีกเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "ที่นี่คือเช็คพอยท์"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "เช็คสติปัญญาของคุณไง!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "ฉันอยู่ที่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "เพื่อช่วยเหลือหรือให้คำแนะนำคนที่หลงทางอย่างคุณ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "แล้วคิดว่าคุณมีอะไรที่ทำให้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "\"ไม่สมควร\" ได้รับความช่วยเหลือรึไง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "ไงนะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "ตาทึ่มเอ้ย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "คุณโผล่มาจากที่ไหนก็ไม่รู้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "คุณไม่ควรมาอยู่ที่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "ฉันก็เลยช่วยคุณ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "บ๊ายบายนะ ตาทึ่ม!"}
